speechtext:
1.	During each of the years 1951 and 1952, how many farmers were operating farms in each province?
2.	How many operators in each province had a net income, (a) less than $500; (b) $500 to $750;
(c)	$750 to $1,000; (d) $1,000 to $1,250; (e) $1,250 to $1,500; (f) $1,500 to $2,000; (g) $2,000 to $2,500 and (h) over $2,500, in the above years?
3.	How many operated farms of, (a) 100 acres or less, (b) 100 to 160 acres; (c) 160 to 320 acres;
(d)	320 to 480 acres; (e) 480 to 640 acres; (f) 640 to 960 acres; (g) 960 to 1,280 acres, and (h) over 1,280 acres, in 1951 and 1952?
4.	What amount of income tax was paid by farmers in each province in each of the above years?
